Pedro,

The issue is that in your ind grouping you have some groups of size one and this function calls the arrayspecs function, which seems to have trouble wrangling with a vector of values rather than a matrix of values.  (This is an issue in R quite often; a single-column  or single-row matrix gets converted to a vector.  Sometimes one has to have a step to force it back into a matrix.)

When I get a chance, I’ll try to add a check into the function for such things.  We do not expect one would try to sort 24 values into 22 groups, so things like this elude us a bit.

Cheers!
Mike

